<title>USA: Two Templeton funds to buy back shrs.</title>
<headline>Two Templeton funds to buy back shrs.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Templeton Global Governments Income Trust and Templeton Global Income Fund Inc each said Wednesday it plans to buy back up to 10 percent of their shares.</p>
<p>Templeton Global Governments said it plans to buy back the shares in the open market from time to time for an aggreggate of two million shares.</p>
<p>Templeton Global said it would buy back up to 12 million shares in the open market from time to time.</p>
</text>
